{"id":"632947","name":"白馒头","author":"どら","authorId":"10454906","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/632947/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"5克"},{"name":"温水","amount":"250克"},{"name":"低粉","amount":"500克"}],"sub":[{"name":"白糖","amount":"30克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"温水加入酵母粉搅拌均匀。","img":"images/632947/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入30克白糖搅拌均匀。","img":"images/632947/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入低粉。","img":"images/632947/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"搅拌均匀成絮状。","img":"images/632947/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"揉成光滑面团。","img":"images/632947/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"盖上湿布发酵至两倍大。","img":"images/632947/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"分别分成小剂子。","img":"images/632947/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"揉成光滑面团入纸托。","img":"images/632947/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"盖上湿布发酵两倍大。","img":"images/632947/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"入锅大火蒸20分钟，焖五分钟。","img":"images/632947/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/632947/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/632947/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}